    "title": "Pianist set to perform at St. Matthew's Sunday",
    "text": "Bulgarian pianist Viktor Valkov will perform at 2 p.m. Sunday, April 19, at St. Matthew’s Episcopal Church, 87 Narragansett Ave.\nThe free concert, sponsored by the Jamestown Community Piano Association, will feature compositions by Bach, Schuman, Charles-Valentin Alkan, Ferruccio Busoni and Dimitar Nenov.\nValkov’s program also will include “Insektarium” by Danish composer Rued Langgaard. Donations to maintain the piano and hire performers will be accepted.",
